How about variations on the ring of hunger?  All cost you 5x food
consumption, but:

+n ring of hunger => regenerate n hp's each turn (ring of regeneration)
+0 ring of hunger => normal ring of hunger       (ring of hunger)
-n ring of hunger => lose n hp's each turn       (ring of death)

The last is particularly nasty.  You'd have to make scrolls of remove
curse or potions of holy water very easy to get.


